message: "If you use this software or the derived results, please cite both the software and the associated article."
title: "Band- and Label-Efficient Hyperspectral Plant Trait Prediction: reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Code, selected wavelengths and result tables for trait-specific beam-search
  wavelength selection, compact regression, masked self-supervised spectral
  pretraining, leave-source-out validation and few-sample affine recalibration
  on the GreenHyperSpectra dataset.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
